abstract: >-
  A lightweight, browser-based tool for creating,
  validating, importing, and exporting DataCite-compliant
  metadata in XML, JSON, and YAML formats. The application
  runs entirely client-side, requires no backend and is
  ideal for researchers, research institutions,
  repositories, libraries and anyone who wants to generate
  or edit DataCite-compliant metadata.
